 ],
 "text": "The scariest thing in your warehouse this Halloween isn't a ghost. It's the invoice you never sent. Peak season just started. Volume's up, the team's flat out, and that's when fees go missing. A pallet that sat past its free storage. A rush order packed after cutoff. Relabeling for a retailer. Your team did the work. Nobody billed it. Each one looks small. Together, they can add up to thousands a month. Not because your team is careless. Because nobody has time to check every job against every contract in November. A system can. It reads the day's work, matches it to the contract, and puts the missing fees in front of you to approve. Find out what you're leaving on the floor. Our free calculator is in the bio."
